  <Name>Pset_DuctSystemDesignCriteria</Name>
  <Definition>Definition from IAI: This property set is used to define the general characteristics of the duct system and is typically attached to an instance of an IfcSystem.

HISTORY: New property set in IFC Release 2.0.

ISSUES: No issues to date.</Definition>
  <Typed>False</Typed>
  <TypedClass></TypedClass>
  <TypeName></TypeName>
